<body>
    <h1>New Super Slick Landing Pages</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 local-id=3D"223329f62eaa" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-SIGN=
=E2=80=91IN/ID&amp;VENTRYPAGE">SIGN=E2=80=91IN / ID&amp;V ENTRY PAGE</h1>
<p local-id=3D"29596bae32ab">Page Type: Entry / Verification<br>
Journey Position: Entry point from SMS generic link<br>
Associated Screens:<br>
=E2=80=93 Sign in (default)<br>
=E2=80=93 Sign in (2 attempts remaining)<br>
=E2=80=93 Sign in locked (3 failed attempts)<br>
=E2=80=93 Account recovery<br>
=E2=80=93 Account locked =E2=80=93 support options</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"d049005e162d" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-1.ProductVisi=
onStatement(Epic)">1. Product Vision Statement (Epic)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"b800ecc9b107">This page acts as the secure gateway into the =
Marston Landing Page journey, enabling verified customers to access persona=
lised case information while maintaining strict compliance, security, and d=
ata protection standards.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"3868fa61afcc" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-2.BusinessObj=
ectives">2. Business Objectives</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"8b6848e2-654b-4823-9223-c59bded4473e">
<li local-id=3D"8fbba706-4d61-4348-ae8b-4220144f8507">
<p local-id=3D"e5fdca251c80">Ensure only verified users can access case dat=
a</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"956ae168-11d2-4332-bf92-dcd3282e7d5c">
<p local-id=3D"72724a3e9d8c">Minimise fraud and unauthorised access</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"99669fcd-b5fe-4400-a9ea-4efccc267f22">
<p local-id=3D"06b8f7fede1e">Reduce agent demand by enabling compliant self=
=E2=80=91serve verification</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1991b0ef-de17-49ef-9ea8-2bb29bec7244">
<p local-id=3D"c4934052ce59">Provide clear recovery paths on failed attempt=
s</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"cf0b7e496c69" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-3.LandingPage=
Strategy&amp;ContentCustomisation">3. Landing Page Strategy &amp; Content C=
ustomisation</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"e1c6037c-0707-4a83-9795-e7663a94eb44">
<li local-id=3D"81373bff-f227-4c44-b985-6068035cf34e">
<p local-id=3D"31e634a008ca">This page uses generic access via SMS link</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"dae5d217-a7b3-4398-9d6c-43e4ba833111">
<p local-id=3D"1566c89748c2">No personal data is displayed pre=E2=80=91veri=
fication</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ca31a1cd-de4d-4d5e-b5e1-281d6f934515">
<p local-id=3D"0c94ce42c11f">Content messaging adapts based on:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"044dc938-5b1b-4691-814c-d9257ad90b7a">
<li local-id=3D"546f0f04-4098-4c43-b962-8ed03d2dcf8e">
<p local-id=3D"6507620d35a0">Attempt count remaining</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ef5f7be6-0bcb-4212-8192-6c4521a0b665">
<p local-id=3D"200ba16151ab">Account locked status</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"707f4f69-9135-4ae9-a708-34d1f8bb7fb8">
<p local-id=3D"3e898a123d7a">Visual reassurance (brand, imagery, security i=
cons) used to reduce abandonment</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"31813264c429" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-4.Tracking&am=
p;ReportingEnhancements">4. Tracking &amp; Reporting Enhancements</h2>
<p local-id=3D"7512edfb05d4">The following events must be tracked:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"baa0de97-c32d-4e4b-92b2-891ebd80d732">
<li local-id=3D"cd0fb8dc-362f-4891-8860-c9bb9a13f6d2">
<p local-id=3D"910fefa54b5d">Page load</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5872db46-0a65-4599-af04-373c6c09c871">
<p local-id=3D"592ade6b325f">Sign=E2=80=91in attempt</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5e928efa-410f-4c95-b5eb-3ae7e821e419">
<p local-id=3D"0ca3a9b1dee4">Attempt failure (counted)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5c970279-8cb4-4923-a584-7d51256d1082">
<p local-id=3D"ec098c7f0e71">Account locked event</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0565f0d8-20df-4867-a5bb-583716f81bd2">
<p local-id=3D"8e6a90bfd2b4">Clicks on:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"e523b0af-8494-4f22-8a47-88abfe1dc3b9">
<li local-id=3D"4394a667-65ce-4fd9-91a0-fa4e3c9b36b7">
<p local-id=3D"d1c74b4d8c84">=E2=80=9CHaving problems signing in?=E2=80=9D<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"287103d8-8997-4540-867b-d7a4dedff6fb">
<p local-id=3D"9e19104c6c5f">=E2=80=9CRecover your account=E2=80=9D</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"37fc47f8-e7e1-4070-bdfc-5f1ee9582671">
<p local-id=3D"376fd3e08e41">Support channel links (phone, email)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"ce54cc81abe4" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-5.Scope">5. S=
cope</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"e1a78850718b" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-InScope:">In =
Scope:</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"9184671f-f98a-4b7a-b5dd-1857b08ad7df">
<li local-id=3D"3a0fe2b6-ea4a-48de-98fb-216238feac70">
<p local-id=3D"4c62fffb2911">Generic sign=E2=80=91in entry</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2fe1ded5-5df0-4dd6-8593-c1a215f0ba69">
<p local-id=3D"5ff3abf557b3">ID&amp;V using Customer Ref &amp; Postcode</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"7b9699c2-7956-4615-9c80-de0cd627fcea">
<p local-id=3D"f017ba4338e0">Attempt tracking (3 attempts)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ef995044-a5e3-48ed-b172-8735b8d30f4b">
<p local-id=3D"7c814c22f9f9">Account lockout handling</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"165f4f56-26df-4c20-8d2e-d3bf04a4bfde">
<p local-id=3D"fe9ef7f7b59f">Account recovery options</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"951ed1f7-78b6-4adc-aead-c58e6937e9b8">
<p local-id=3D"2a3c377e3ecc">Link to support channels</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"f3ab0d6c3306" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-OutofScope:">=
Out of Scope:</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"7d4b3dce-a431-4f5e-a9e4-859c1bd14e7f">
<li local-id=3D"fc433b95-3313-4833-a00e-95d75154596e">
<p local-id=3D"f69ca8ea24a8">Voice IVR</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2b3ec4d1-4901-430f-afd5-d4a1197b1301">
<p local-id=3D"a7e5200c8788">Live agent verification on page</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aad14e01-974e-4370-9d0c-7d3db58417fd">
<p local-id=3D"48c3f846a744">AI validation</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"ef7f8b6c59d8" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-6.Users">6. U=
sers</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"19992650-1c5e-4375-bf39-e02680cc8538">
<li local-id=3D"2d0c8c23-b19b-4c1f-b77f-d49578a6f653">
<p local-id=3D"a2c5b5106470"><strong>Customers</strong>: Accessing via SMS =
link</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a976c7a0-cb70-4444-a5d7-8d596d228acd">
<p local-id=3D"3d653262fb3f"><strong>Agents</strong>: Indirect (support rou=
te only)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6dfd5877-48ca-45d8-9603-dca578e2bdef">
<p local-id=3D"b9686d742dcd"><strong>Compliance Tracking</strong>: Oversigh=
t only</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"774f15a33bc5" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-7.BusinessReq=
uirements(BR)">7. Business Requirements (BR)</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"8=
fd0b001-71d5-4fbe-8293-958d705c977f" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8043f509-97a0-4605-a853-905b7905c523">
<th data-local-id=3D"b194a685-e32a-4ab7-a933-ed74cc2b6258" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5c82048490e2">BR ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"1fb9bfe0-20e8-4293-ab53-2987ff0c105e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"eeeff73be944">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c33928d4-be68-467c-8301-4564a4c37e39">
<td data-local-id=3D"33fe6de9-a833-4577-97bd-814d8c10f387" class=3D"conflue=
