<h2 local-id=3D"5af1bc64030a" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-8.BusinessRul=
es">8. Business Rules</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"f78cdeb7-4778-4752-87f6-eee13b5fa792">
<li local-id=3D"3bb2e7c2-10d6-42aa-ac80-66f3e0af7f96">
<p local-id=3D"4a50e8004f04">Maximum 3 failed ID&amp;V attempts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2e9ce37b-db3f-4b44-ac3c-3200a3991665">
<p local-id=3D"b259051ec96f">After 3 failures:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"a895876c-f6c6-467d-ab1d-0dd02618f5e2">
<li local-id=3D"844cb8d3-9b07-4a28-863b-f0f8fe2845f3">
<p local-id=3D"d5f9aadf32c5">Sign=E2=80=91in is temporarily locked</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d882dfe3-e86a-447d-a48d-58c9a0a5ff1b">
<p local-id=3D"b136027cabe1">Self=E2=80=91service recovery is required</p><=
/li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"082efb9b-0fec-4bff-9909-81ec2d5fc667">
<p local-id=3D"e5b1f56d3f06">UK postcode validation:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"534b115e-bbe0-4eff-9dea-86c1959692c8">
<li local-id=3D"c15bf7e7-e907-4fb6-871e-5f703e969f4f">
<p local-id=3D"e42aed83693d">Case=E2=80=91insensitive</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"69e554bb-6d6a-497c-ace6-6f6aeb263b66">
<p local-id=3D"5a6708075f83">Whitespace normalised</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"383ca94d-6508-4f99-b9a5-bfe2974334bd">
<p local-id=3D"202980140171">All sessions:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"80813975-691d-4de0-9726-0dd55cf58f6f">
<li local-id=3D"cde0cd98-f0f1-4374-a745-f71017601455">
<p local-id=3D"8fb9e75fc308">Encrypted</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2a9048b4-560f-4dbf-b41d-21476d6b8ea3">
<p local-id=3D"ec9731458d88">Single=E2=80=91use token</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"ab8d77fae21a" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-9.Personalisa=
tionLogic">9. Personalisation Logic</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"9237acc7-8a0b-45c0-ad1c-fb28f84e7fa4">
<li local-id=3D"8235f24f-f458-4e71-9e9a-cd2dd98befb6">
<p local-id=3D"13ef89fcb755">No personalisation prior to successful verific=
ation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bc196d9e-35c9-48c8-a782-81cf4fdc32c6">
<p local-id=3D"f40492ee9be4">Messaging varies only by:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"709e964b-eec0-42d3-9256-f656befe3b77">
<li local-id=3D"68158a03-5c66-4dac-b260-e99d89cb7897">
<p local-id=3D"aca407bed480">Attempt count remaining</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"30e9127f-bf27-4a1b-ac64-3b0eb72d178a">
<p local-id=3D"b345bba53e54">Locked vs unlocked state</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"953b9000dae4" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-10.BusinessPr=
ocess/Illustration">10. Business Process / Illustration</h2>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"59a7515b-61c1-465e-ad10-b823520721d4">
<li local-id=3D"80ae13f4-65e3-44e5-aada-86b2d206f73c">
<p local-id=3D"6249c97947cb">Customer clicks SMS link</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e213932d-0a41-4805-9736-ecf88c7b914c">
<p local-id=3D"421314aab74d">Generic sign=E2=80=91in page loads</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dc3e006b-c047-4134-a239-7f921dc64b88">
<p local-id=3D"002d5c564b5a">Customer enters Postcode</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0a64aaff-eff7-419b-9c78-9e2457223eb8">
<p local-id=3D"8f17b462e082">System validates via Columbus</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1ec63692-deaa-4e2d-8527-18691f998392">
<p local-id=3D"e91fe9769807">On success =E2=86=92 redirect to Home / Paymen=
t Landing Page</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"36245359-8f0c-4afc-b4fa-3e1042febe50">
<p local-id=3D"a140c482e3a5">On failure =E2=86=92 Re-attempt</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4aa0c123-937a-4452-9b3d-c84e352f1e88">
<p local-id=3D"76e87c253d65">On third failure =E2=86=92 lock account and di=
splay recovery options</p></li>
</ol>
