<h1 local-id=3D"a4cd54395b84" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-LANDINGPAGE(H=
omePage/TimelineOverview)">LANDING PAGE (Home Page/Timeline Overview)</h1>
<p local-id=3D"ddf14eea0813"><strong>Page Type:</strong> Primary Landing Pa=
ge<br><strong>Journey Position:</strong> First page post=E2=80=91successful=
 ID&amp;V<br><strong>Purpose: </strong>Provide customers with a clear, pers=
onalised overview of their case, their current enforcement stage, urgency l=
evel, and the most critical next action (typically payment).</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"bc7421ed62c2" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-1.ProductVisi=
onStatement(Epic).1">1. Product Vision Statement (Epic)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"92cd4996de96">This page is the primary self=E2=80=91service =
interface replacing the legacy VIVR experience. It must clearly communicate=
 the customer=E2=80=99s enforcement position, create an appropriate sense o=
f urgency, and drive completion of the next best action (e.g. payment), whi=
le remaining compliant, accessible, and non=E2=80=91aggressive.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"edfa256b003b" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-2.BusinessObj=
ectives.1">2. Business Objectives</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"83454769-58ea-4e46-9ef7-b24dbd791fe9">
<li local-id=3D"3c873344-224b-429c-8bd0-79c2a505ea1f">
<p local-id=3D"652580010114">Reduce inbound agent calls by clearly explaini=
ng case status</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9716352e-9eb6-4428-a5ad-b2b7c7e7d3eb">
<p local-id=3D"a6147921a0c3">Drive successful self=E2=80=91service payments=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"90c7cbc0-1672-471e-8841-77d722d87f4b">
<p local-id=3D"cad64bd41836">Reduce disputes arising from misunderstanding =
enforcement stages</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3f08f094-d16f-43c0-a297-23d53e5b2962">
<p local-id=3D"6c21788da3dc">Maintain compliance and transparency</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3a956987-1a1c-4366-9d0d-5b2b3ac6ac8e">
<p local-id=3D"d770b1a73dc6">Support multi=E2=80=91case customers without c=
onfusion</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"571b7821f95d" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-3.LandingPage=
Strategy&amp;ContentCustomisation.1">3. Landing Page Strategy &amp; Content=
 Customisation</h2>
<p local-id=3D"92af2bc0f13a">Content on this page is fully personalised pos=
t=E2=80=91ID&amp;V and must adapt based on:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"03788d01-12a8-4137-a08d-45c7d0013f52">
<li local-id=3D"2ebf0441-f8da-4771-a0d7-d674d4a483b2">
<p local-id=3D"e78753a7ddf8">Case reference selected</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1a649480-ad40-4b9d-b2b9-74087f108d29">
<p local-id=3D"88d082eb48ed">Debt type (e.g. PCN, Council Tax, Road Traffic=
)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a4370923-d309-4648-92da-9f6c955375a0">
<p local-id=3D"a15d6cfc5c2e">Enforcement stage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7be730e6-c799-45c1-b842-96c6d3da42f8">
<p local-id=3D"ebadfa6b5e27">Time remaining in Compliance (if applicable)</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8bf9abf6-d4e4-43c5-ac73-7bfafa80bdc6">
<p local-id=3D"f6b81ef1e183">Single=E2=80=91case vs Multi=E2=80=91case cust=
omers</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"a738c4501c2c">The page prioritises <strong>visual explanatio=
n first, action second</strong>, by leading with the timeline.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"f27cf5eacf67" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-4.Tracking&am=
p;ReportingEnhancements.1">4. Tracking &amp; Reporting Enhancements</h2>
<p local-id=3D"93372441fe57">The following interactions must be tracked:</p=
>
<ul local-id=3D"0c7a9078-d0bc-45b3-a038-d01b767d7edc">
<li local-id=3D"1b6b8407-6ba7-481a-b1ea-092ef94383f3">
<p local-id=3D"02a591607f36">Page load (with case reference)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fec46d9b-8f95-47df-a78d-9a8daac659a7">
<p local-id=3D"de639331fbbb">Timeline stage hovered / tapped</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e8811073-ecfd-4c50-92f7-d820c78481dc">
<p local-id=3D"cfd1a651b587">Media panel interaction (video viewed, animati=
on triggered)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"307e46e4-85a4-46e6-bbc9-3d5225fb3024">
<p local-id=3D"e27ae6d11275">Case selector usage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2bd57f00-335b-4143-b0cf-11a34a570c34">
<p local-id=3D"cc7cb3b329ca">Primary CTA clicks (=E2=80=9CPay now=E2=80=9D)=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0fd0a139-4472-4d0f-a13e-65ec2ae629a7">
<p local-id=3D"082573a32413">Secondary CTA clicks (support, information lin=
ks)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"15748381bdc6">All tracking events must include:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"b3a4b679-909c-4c8e-ac03-128122da4593">
<li local-id=3D"5a203a4f-0eba-4fdd-bda8-f2a44f669bca">
<p local-id=3D"756f74926e51">Case type</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"afbc0ba3-15bd-48c0-ab46-0f25c460ca8c">
<p local-id=3D"88979f02a47c">Stage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fae3474e-64f9-448c-b1ae-659d9d6fb2d9">
<p local-id=3D"54890fca7a7d">Multi=E2=80=91case flag (true/false)</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"c0f686cecf6e" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-5.Scope.1">5.=
 Scope</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"c1dca4526e00" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-InScope">In S=
cope</h3>
