<h2 local-id=3D"5361f58fbc48" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-8.BusinessRul=
es.1">8. Business Rules</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"f24998cb-94d2-4dba-a713-acb5fd922ce1">
<li local-id=3D"01d4ae3d-7e54-41c4-9a4d-4c117a62ae58">
<p local-id=3D"11e8cd8fe084">Only verified users may access this page</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"44202bd6-0626-4aba-ba4f-d943e9fc3187">
<p local-id=3D"e4df5a11c2db">Display one case at a time</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d5d09ad8-a173-4ab2-8c14-fb54dddaf041">
<p local-id=3D"a754aacbc31e">If multiple cases exist:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7cc49469-0005-4a8e-b72b-9ebab0c0c823">
<li local-id=3D"d54346e6-b3fa-4ef5-a4de-aedb2c3d3e64">
<p local-id=3D"b9428aca9bc0">Default to the most urgent case</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"1e8cd6a1-a63c-4572-9348-95349b8b9e30">
<p local-id=3D"5573664ec3a2">Enforcement fees and balances must always matc=
h Columbus</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"337ed27f-53cf-45e7-a61e-2563d0523786">
<p local-id=3D"04dbf0e2e237">Countdown timers only appear in Compliance sta=
ge</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"7e9f5218f32a" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-9.Personalisa=
tionLogic.1">9. Personalisation Logic</h2>
<p local-id=3D"553b77e8d9d2">Personalisation is driven by verified case dat=
a:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"6fe32b14-d264-4010-8237-7244183c5aad">
<li local-id=3D"5230e56e-d735-46cc-8df9-467115d786bd">
<p local-id=3D"8cb4d4dcd198">Customer name (greeting)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"29ce35ef-6cc8-4922-86e4-a161d07984ab">
<p local-id=3D"7badf8940b1c">Case reference</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f6391a7f-434c-42ac-9515-cfdfd3e6df42">
<p local-id=3D"0889294c22fc">Debt type</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2a158323-41b4-461d-acb9-68db958bb9f7">
<p local-id=3D"75073e376b53">Enforcement stage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4ef8111a-987b-42e1-a8c6-2c23c52485cc">
<p local-id=3D"d93bf2c6cc5c">Fee amount</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"197c3552-38d4-4a89-a4fd-80739276a544">
<p local-id=3D"34a18811ba1e">Time remaining (if applicable)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"cd715f884f4c">No personalisation is stored client=E2=80=91si=
de.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"77a97eed3770" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-10.BusinessPr=
ocess/Illustration.1">10. Business Process / Illustration</h2>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"6e309cb2-a204-4477-afe6-a72e5833cb6a">
<li local-id=3D"2ec329c5-e53e-4f21-87fc-8a919507a6a3">
