<li local-id=3D"343bced1-1f4c-4400-8468-f52adfc5702f">
<p local-id=3D"555001639c33">System retrieves all active cases</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1c5a578f-5fc4-487d-82e2-03e779d9f62b">
