<h1 local-id=3D"1afc8c77c8dc" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-LANDINGPAGE(M=
akeAPayment)">LANDING PAGE (Make A Payment)</h1>
<p local-id=3D"c57340b1cde3"><strong>Page Type:</strong> Transactional Paym=
ent Page<br><strong>Journey Position:</strong> Reached from Home / Timeline=
 via primary CTA<br><strong>Purpose: </strong>Enable customers to securely =
make a payment against a selected case, with absolute clarity on amount, fe=
es, urgency, and outcome.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"bcac1adc3d74" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-1.ProductVisi=
onStatement(Epic).2">1. Product Vision Statement (Epic)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"5a379c3cc48e">This page enables secure, compliant, and frict=
ion=E2=80=91reduced self=E2=80=91service payments, supporting the organisat=
ion=E2=80=99s goal of replacing agent=E2=80=91led payment handling and lega=
cy IVR solutions with a digital=E2=80=91first experience.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"f6617fb5f20b" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-2.BusinessObj=
ectives.2">2. Business Objectives</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"0299279c-35e7-4030-836b-83b7a8ae77bb">
<li local-id=3D"ce46a5e9-ddae-46c4-a67c-136efcd9db0c">
<p local-id=3D"afa720736417">Drive successful payment completion</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c1f455d8-a7e9-442c-8cb4-3e48b761682c">
<p local-id=3D"cdf72bc46018">Reduce agent=E2=80=91assisted payment calls</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"67695a90-58bf-4f62-90bb-6697677cf76f">
<p local-id=3D"b049c781df29">Avoid disputes caused by unclear fees or balan=
ces</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5fe4f3d8-9114-4a1f-ba61-32e9a6e19161">
<p local-id=3D"eb27f73d2de5">Maintain PCI, GDPR, and enforcement compliance=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ff51b1fd-fa0e-422b-b39a-8d16e0761c56">
<p local-id=3D"c49b45efb0fc">Minimise drop=E2=80=91off during payment flow<=
/p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"6da018eda3cc" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-3.LandingPage=
Strategy&amp;ContentCustomisation.2">3. Landing Page Strategy &amp; Content=
 Customisation</h2>
<p local-id=3D"70f2b5675f7a">Content on this page is fully personalised and=
 dependent on:</p>
