<h2 local-id=3D"9fc44f9c7f88" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-8.BusinessRul=
es.2">8. Business Rules</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"7bf3b7df-31d9-4c81-8a5d-5ce920a3c6e4">
<li local-id=3D"e0999204-ba4d-4746-b174-1ddd54dc24db">
<p local-id=3D"f1d83e4f2a97">Payment must always be tied to the active case=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4176e7d9-9c76-4185-b061-00f841eb2192">
<p local-id=3D"697bfa2108fc">Amounts displayed must exactly match Columbus<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bb9b4c4a-c342-4420-902c-18f7b82c0267">
<p local-id=3D"b05537377cd1">If partial payments are not allowed:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"fb01f29e-d74f-4c80-9351-3909c5b8d689">
<li local-id=3D"42aef516-3354-4820-915e-434d846ac78b">
<p local-id=3D"8bc6cce32465">Full payment is enforced</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"ade86112-4c87-4873-a1fa-f91898240072">
<p local-id=3D"7c9c48280ef2">Payment attempts must not lock the user out of=
 the portal</p></li>
</ul>
