<h1 local-id=3D"62c307a1e8bd" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-(Enforcement/=
InformationalPage)">(Enforcement/Informational Page)</h1>
<p local-id=3D"ec11a0b211cb"><strong>Page Type:</strong> Informational / Be=
haviour=E2=80=91shaping<br><strong>Journey Position:</strong> Accessed from=
 Home / Timeline (via hover, tap, or secondary links)<br><strong>Primary Pu=
rpose: </strong>Explain enforcement stages, consequences, and next steps in=
 a clear, compliant, non=E2=80=91aggressive way that reduces disputes and i=
ncreases payment action.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"2c11de11ed45" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-1.ProductVisi=
onStatement(Epic).3">1. Product Vision Statement (Epic)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"f43b9bc98354">These pages exist to <strong>replace verbal en=
forcement explanations previously handled by agents or VIVR</strong>, ensur=
ing customers understand the seriousness, timing, and impact of enforcement=
 actions while maintaining trust, transparency, and compliance.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"421815d84d2e" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-2.BusinessObj=
ectives.3">2. Business Objectives</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"d650f1b6-a49c-4cdf-818e-fdce8814053b">
<li local-id=3D"f1a275cd-3a8d-4b3e-88e8-40055b46bc76">
<p local-id=3D"0b90d9c0f17c">Reduce disputes caused by misunderstanding enf=
orcement actions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d7e4d078-e768-46ca-918f-e166b3deb80d">
<p local-id=3D"81c7e6d8e16e">Minimise agent explanations of =E2=80=9Cwhat h=
appens next=E2=80=9D</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a369924c-e3ff-49ac-bbce-b69a25b5c2cf">
<p local-id=3D"2d2d19365477">Support informed decision=E2=80=91making</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"55d3d224-98a9-49d5-a99a-01bcf61aa055">
<p local-id=3D"4c17dabf0ab8">Reinforce urgency without aggression</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"415068a6-e444-4eba-b181-54d8708923f4">
<p local-id=3D"0af850e7c740">Increase payment conversion through clarity</p=
></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"0fd452cee530" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-3.LandingPage=
Strategy&amp;ContentCustomisation.3">3. Landing Page Strategy &amp; Content=
 Customisation</h2>
<p local-id=3D"71ad51bbfc58">Content is case=E2=80=91aware and stage=E2=80=
=91specific, adjusting dynamically based on:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7b1b44db-b6c3-4be8-b565-21bc6d54a229">
<li local-id=3D"a81f121b-e22d-46d3-b7b9-51146afc78d4">
<p local-id=3D"45360f9bafe8">Enforcement stage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6fc7a663-9259-47b9-b28d-bc1a6d9edbe0">
<p local-id=3D"f7d20115a161">Debt type</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6e2a385d-dc8e-442c-bc24-97362f833acb">
<p local-id=3D"04841b976c6f">Fee threshold reached</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6abbca01-b14b-4a20-9f60-666c76cece1a">
<p local-id=3D"2fe953aa433a">Time remaining (if applicable)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d4441b77a403">Content must never be generic =E2=80=94 it sho=
uld always refer to:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"fdfd7e05-501e-4672-a9dc-0c61fcf2e57d">
<li local-id=3D"87c38bf8-a9c9-432a-a875-3fe8927460ec">
<p local-id=3D"c3303e3e8c66">The current stage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c27a799e-c4b5-4c27-bc37-82ccea565e66">
<p local-id=3D"3b1f9d1f49b4">The next stage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"69f332a9-d98e-4cc6-a73a-2b94eccf06e2">
<p local-id=3D"3ff26d64e669">The impact of not acting</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"e1b868f67a56" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-4.Tracking&am=
p;ReportingEnhancements.3">4. Tracking &amp; Reporting Enhancements</h2>
<p local-id=3D"0ffd72964897">Track the following interactions:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"83afab0f-e2a5-4f5f-8e81-02d7df0dec3a">
<li local-id=3D"decb282a-123f-4daa-9d15-a3adbc41b12d">
<p local-id=3D"52ccea1ecf24">Enforcement page / modal opened</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d7350d84-a822-4b46-8730-34bd84f2c844">
<p local-id=3D"f2ee4e404de1">Stage viewed</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"59c92ffc-b7e9-47e5-9e1e-b76c87f33ef1">
<p local-id=3D"3bff8fd33531">Media engagement</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cdb5f363-043b-48e5-8357-bee1dd161e54">
<p local-id=3D"0b901eb7a877">CTA clicks (Pay Now / Return / Get Support)</p=
></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"439c30b99842">All tracking events tagged with:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"0f986922-1047-4eed-9fa3-40be81b98e59">
<li local-id=3D"19459146-91a6-4ace-ba25-cd2660c5f190">
<p local-id=3D"08152dbbe1ee">Case reference</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e35d10dd-4776-4102-a669-c88a9fe477ec">
<p local-id=3D"e0a885e6cdf8">Stage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8a8e0e86-d5a8-43a5-9844-d7fa1801b6c6">
<p local-id=3D"353dbfecf212">Debt type</p></li>
</ul>
