<h2 local-id=3D"0052dcdabba6" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-8.BusinessRul=
es.3">8. Business Rules</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"eeeb9c9e-b29f-4c16-b41c-3a0607e36111">
<li local-id=3D"e08f315e-cd5e-4760-b8c3-c73c3d4337b8">
<p local-id=3D"e289a067875c">Only show current and future stages</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0a481998-37e2-4178-84ba-d49cb99c9248">
<p local-id=3D"04cfd7e9b680">Never show irrelevant enforcement steps</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"57bc32b1-c10d-4e42-a1c0-b231c12bad3b">
<p local-id=3D"96009799ef25">If a fee increase applies:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"10d76520-eb13-4238-b4c8-33e01b222526">
<li local-id=3D"ea8cce67-2f73-4e54-8e8a-ff458479f866">
<p local-id=3D"88e490bc3498">It must be explicitly stated</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"3234957b-11be-4817-8c0c-b58d29036005">
<p local-id=3D"6df054e4a389">Enforcement explanations must be factual, neut=
ral, and compliant</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"65625f5b7a12" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-9.Personalisa=
tionLogic.3">9. Personalisation Logic</h2>
<p local-id=3D"276d9c3121eb">Enforcement content must adapt based on:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"16ee7986-8055-42f6-9300-ee99047bee5d">
<li local-id=3D"22516795-6ad4-49f6-b529-62c84293794e">
