<h1 local-id=3D"952510ffecc2" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-LANDINGPAGE5(=
SupportPages)">LANDING PAGE 5 (Support Pages)</h1>
<p local-id=3D"9b73c0e9436c"><strong>Page Type:</strong> Support / Assistan=
ce<br><strong>Journey Position:</strong> Accessible from all other landing =
pages (secondary CTA)<br><strong>Primary Purpose:</strong><br>
Provide customers with clear, compliant support options and self=E2=80=91se=
rve assistance without undermining the primary payment journey.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"3978848fde1b" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-1.ProductVisi=
onStatement(Epic).4">1. Product Vision Statement (Epic)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"4fac09711f54">The Support page provides customers with reass=
urance and guidance at moments of uncertainty, ensuring vulnerable or confu=
sed users can access appropriate help without defaulting to unnecessary age=
nt calls.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"c5ee790d2351" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-2.BusinessObj=
ectives.4">2. Business Objectives</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"1aa7bdd8-7f0b-42a6-a9da-bd5987abef4b">
<li local-id=3D"2d053d58-60ac-4d73-98c4-663283865270">
<p local-id=3D"85309ae72dd5">Reduce avoidable contact by improving clarity<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"10a8e479-51d0-476b-827e-1674f8e036d0">
<p local-id=3D"14c7086789d8">Provide compliant escalation routes</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c7015e03-dba3-4f53-b561-1fd0c579769f">
<p local-id=3D"a2e979009fad">Support vulnerable users appropriately</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"5bd03fa3-b112-4818-9f5f-115052178736">
<p local-id=3D"edb3ff0058c6">Maintain trust and transparency</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c046bfdc-2930-4285-9a27-02e0bae085a1">
<p local-id=3D"0bc9a98e9296">Prevent abandonment due to confusion or fear</=
p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"0140f00f8496" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-3.LandingPage=
Strategy&amp;ContentCustomisation.4">3. Landing Page Strategy &amp; Content=
 Customisation</h2>
<p local-id=3D"166a3731f484">This page is <strong>context=E2=80=91aware but=
 not enforcement=E2=80=91led</strong>.</p>
<p local-id=3D"02389418024c">Content adapts based on:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"20289459-76fc-4e87-a075-6a20d58d05dc">
<li local-id=3D"3cf7b4f1-2880-4c27-b357-9160a1a29c0b">
<p local-id=3D"bd3fc7567d3e">Debt type</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d15b4295-e9c6-4eee-acab-10d4da9602eb">
<p local-id=3D"8bc1baa58b20">Current enforcement stage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3bfac879-db50-4ee3-8a04-5d8019c384e4">
<p local-id=3D"f65b8d968750">User=E2=80=99s journey entry point (Timeline, =
Payment, Enforcement)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"fcaebb6720c8">Tone must be:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ab393beb-ee50-4be4-8245-788a8ebf380f">
<li local-id=3D"26b2848b-ce89-46b0-9369-bfcc8a692e93">
<p local-id=3D"ca391ebf389c">Clear</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9db6593c-a3d8-4074-9af7-f454bc035012">
<p local-id=3D"4f85398d7a7e">Calm</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d27f4462-cbb4-4b58-a7ec-58c384996687">
<p local-id=3D"d698bc44569a">Supportive</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4741a90a-a68f-4ca9-8624-9e3bacf30df8">
<p local-id=3D"49a9bbb550ae">Non=E2=80=91judgemental</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"bf9d9537722f">Enforcement terminology must be factual and ex=
planatory only.</p>
