<h1 local-id=3D"8c33d4f98279" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-StandardisedC=
omponents">Standardised Components</h1>
<p local-id=3D"da44b70a62ad">These components are shared across all landing=
 pages and must behave consistently, regardless of journey entry point or c=
ase type.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"6800b6ab24b2" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-21.GlobalHead=
er">21. Global Header</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"f1f109a37bff" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Purpose">Purp=
ose</h3>
<p local-id=3D"4be928481840">Provide brand reassurance, consistency, and or=
ientation without encouraging unnecessary navigation.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"6f7d801f6167" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Requirements"=
>Requirements</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"bd755903-491f-4bdb-968a-48f8d2352428">
<li local-id=3D"6143c65a-b758-41cb-90f0-92118a656d71">
<p local-id=3D"71cfd1a501b8">Display brand logo only</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"18df4b9c-7fab-47ad-9ccc-e236e2f13ac7">
<p local-id=3D"c05090318eeb">No global navigation menu on desktop</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"82fd2905-d926-413d-9a8b-09a576dc3d6b">
<p local-id=3D"89def21ebca2">Logo is non=E2=80=91clickable (to avoid journe=
y exit)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ffe1209b-741d-4803-a9cc-b8d36e7562d6">
<p local-id=3D"29132cd09062">Header height consistent across pages</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"41bf1b31eb51" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Non=E2=80=91F=
unctional">Non=E2=80=91Functional</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"cfa8b965-5126-43c9-9c36-f285a061e2d4">
<li local-id=3D"0fc5fb47-733b-41f8-889d-e9510e407e29">
<p local-id=3D"43ae3bd90661">Responsive across all breakpoints</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"565a30bd-7d6e-4662-b49a-ce26c4c59106">
<p local-id=3D"16b877a2f489">Must not consume excessive vertical space on m=
obile</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"9f688ba5e242" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-22.GlobalFoot=
er">22. Global Footer</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"4975ccc8d321" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Purpose.1">Pu=
rpose</h3>
<p local-id=3D"41486ee3c9a9">Provide compliance, legal assurances, and seco=
ndary support links.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"c7703e8c56af" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Requirements.=
1">Requirements</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"df16cb82-b905-499b-a431-52bb40a49982">
<li local-id=3D"3e6c0ff7-fd10-4a27-88d4-5132f37c6082">
<p local-id=3D"060ef37034f7">Display:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"01061bab-fd1c-4579-ac99-44cb252b6f56">
<li local-id=3D"bcde1638-6cc8-4af6-b193-f55fd1ee8f25">
<p local-id=3D"4c1651b5ebb2">Privacy Policy</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d39ab55c-1d99-4ac4-8c1e-e14c69f52563">
<p local-id=3D"701af9dcd12e">Terms &amp; Conditions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"131fde9c-d1f3-4552-8e7e-44b29d354237">
<p local-id=3D"06ac755ebd22">Accessibility Statement</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"b34a4e98-ee2d-4ac7-a28e-745b7936857c">
<p local-id=3D"14a3d895e652">Footer content configurable per portfolio</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"007a91a5-1f11-4978-a1fe-3229012b3d4b">
<p local-id=3D"735414dc53b4">Footer must not distract from primary CTA</p><=
/li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"260dde4f317d" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-23.MobileMenu=
(Global)">23. Mobile Menu (Global)</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"2220e994b676" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Purpose.2">Pu=
rpose</h3>
<p local-id=3D"2d2cddc5e9d2">Provide access to secondary pages in constrain=
ed screen widths without disrupting the core journey.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"4c424d2d39cc" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Behaviour">Be=
haviour</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"bd8573c6-1e5f-4571-bf30-d7fd205cfd30">
<li local-id=3D"db626cb1-8106-446e-a867-cf63ced639b9">
<p local-id=3D"c885fc7cd5a1">Appears only on mobile viewports</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"35a5c2c8-dfa3-4dc0-9498-3be855e479aa">
<p local-id=3D"89a2369c2ae4">Slide=E2=80=91in or drawer pattern</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b425e688-cc00-4055-9c7a-bd9a8b50fe03">
<p local-id=3D"762620af48e9">Menu items:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"f838cb52-373f-440a-a1f0-6174baf50074">
<li local-id=3D"a1c20235-54ef-4ec8-8cae-1cf1a7b4c88f">
<p local-id=3D"12826dd897eb">Home / Overview</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d3be7981-a145-4f23-9a8c-e72525793298">
<p local-id=3D"fde317da0479">Make a Payment</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e1b5b175-5053-4234-aa4f-97128ab3a194">
<p local-id=3D"b5a94d68ca45">Support</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"e8704438-b8b3-4b63-9d63-689574af8f9e">
<p local-id=3D"d262eaaefab8">Active page highlighted</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"b3e67038a62c" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Rules">Rules<=
/h3>
<ul local-id=3D"9503b539-738c-4fa2-a520-eb1158c1f67c">
<li local-id=3D"4bf306ca-b50a-444b-8a1a-5584711c2ea2">
<p local-id=3D"0a48a5d95622">Menu must <strong>never expose sensitive data<=
/strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3ab7a398-804e-42c2-a83d-27b07751a3a0">
<p local-id=3D"96c98933c1c6">Closing menu returns user to prior scroll posi=
tion</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"42042e45b5be" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-24.GlobalModa=
ls">24. Global Modals</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"631f05692c75" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Purpose.3">Pu=
rpose</h3>
<p local-id=3D"5bea63203094">Provide contextual explanations and confirmati=
ons without full page transitions.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"29f9e1ba5482" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-ModalTypes">M=
odal Types</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"e9cd221c-757c-4d84-841a-c05b17df0c99">
<li local-id=3D"3d460ef1-2b1c-4d8b-b139-30644045859e">
<p local-id=3D"025ddc498a13">Enforcement explanation modal</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2fab1f90-3f69-4acd-976f-59bd219bb0e9">
<p local-id=3D"8e231573e693">Fee explanation modal</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5aa637c7-042f-4896-afb2-ce3cc9ea3615">
<p local-id=3D"e146ee01543d">Information / reassurance modal</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2e933bac-ba4c-4086-8eb3-6171d000e85e">
<p local-id=3D"70908865db1e">Error / warning modal</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"81384bc76302" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Behaviour.1">=
Behaviour</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"f3516ebf-db98-44bc-952c-4c5bbeb929fb">
<li local-id=3D"c8bf9b15-a4c5-4f90-993b-f5109f838d31">
<p local-id=3D"196fade97d87">Background dimmed</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"91f298fd-e8d7-4455-8cf4-588828611d4e">
<p local-id=3D"6583f898d2fd">Escape key closes modal (desktop)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ecf395c3-4546-4963-abd2-b0722bd7236a">
<p local-id=3D"b5c1094200d9">Tap=E2=80=91outside closes modal (mobile)</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"a3a85002-506b-4cd5-b4ae-6d664fddaa88">
<p local-id=3D"bc1ba1b43933">No layout shift on open or close</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"bc888af6f314" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-25.GlobalErro=
rStates">25. Global Error States</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"4e5851b8ca97" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-ErrorCategori=
es">Error Categories</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"d9c4f173-ddde-4fbe-8939-0199185f91cc">
<li local-id=3D"76568dcc-3a8b-4015-b907-d09a5b465a3f">
<p local-id=3D"3fc99df0eb5a"><strong>System Errors</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"14b0a1fe-e1db-4ecf-a7e5-4bd01a0f7687">
<li local-id=3D"a9d243b1-63a3-4806-b1a8-936b30dc59e9">
<p local-id=3D"b5227127f581">Columbus unavailable</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f9f55676-ae51-41b6-ab35-77da16b12be5">
<p local-id=3D"9b5b81d38e4b">Payment gateway failure</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"55dd4ce0-4db7-4e6d-adb7-f4566e7b922f">
<p local-id=3D"326a021aed96"><strong>User Errors</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"7a5541bc-dd17-4ac5-87ec-627e4914aad8">
<li local-id=3D"c10a6b7d-645d-4a4d-b999-4a98029ba6e3">
<p local-id=3D"eb922f480a32">Invalid input</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6e4054f4-6f81-4a7f-a585-e96354d16f9b">
<p local-id=3D"df367c818f03">Timeout</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"6db655667934" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Requirements.=
2">Requirements</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"588ab534-867d-4137-bb15-60b28f53c30d">
<li local-id=3D"1661aad5-b319-46d7-bf53-a86d6aa7e930">
<p local-id=3D"4d186c17af3c">Clear error description</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9f839dc8-6612-47c5-987e-46a0db6a66da">
<p local-id=3D"1239b670b734">Actionable recovery option</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"74eefb9f-d25a-4b31-899b-191dfad96f50">
<p local-id=3D"a925333ff931">No technical language</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d7c4dd2c-89a8-45e9-a881-faf783bc2a15">
<p local-id=3D"4d8c099f333a">Errors logged with context:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"e18b04b5-bfd9-48ae-be2c-671f0b42aa96">
<li local-id=3D"fbddb8f2-b8a1-4ac7-a833-c037d941732f">
<p local-id=3D"2eaea457507d">Page</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"40a77e37-b578-434c-b731-70cde0281269">
<p local-id=3D"c7e2820c1a83">Case reference</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"478303a2-382c-4141-a3b0-d9df50a44ecd">
<p local-id=3D"cb0f02561780">Stage</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"cb32ab249c6d" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-26.GlobalNoti=
fications&amp;Banners">26. Global Notifications &amp; Banners</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"defe33a0a892" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Purpose.4">Pu=
rpose</h3>
<p local-id=3D"479f2e608185">Communicate critical but non=E2=80=91blocking =
information.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"0de99514d345" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Rules.1">Rule=
s</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"4bf3c09d-7cd1-4cf0-a86e-f06b98fedec9">
<li local-id=3D"079028b7-20f9-43fe-9802-77d97801d381">
<p local-id=3D"7c1751dfc7b1">Must not obscure CTAs</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"215843f0-5c3e-416b-bf34-6770abdf749c">
<p local-id=3D"98eb83452af7">Must be dismissible (unless critical)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"53af5a4d-2dcf-4ba8-80ae-85dc72623bbc">
<p local-id=3D"0ec0fb8cc9ab">Severity hierarchy:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"b7be5c69-ff7b-4bbe-894a-f35e7b680cf6">
<li local-id=3D"5cc7456e-8a01-4665-a0a7-d47a911f81f3">
<p local-id=3D"78e18a0c443e">Info (blue)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"987352b0-58b8-4573-ab0e-60966c6c11bc">
<p local-id=3D"e1127bca63a6">Warning (amber)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"df360d16-fc94-4ee7-9117-5a59313daf53">
<p local-id=3D"65e338e6ec4f">Critical (red)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"7cf7eacc3cc6"></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"0888d8e66487" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-FullEnd=E2=80=
=91to=E2=80=91EndCustomerJourney"><strong>Full End=E2=80=91to=E2=80=91End C=
ustomer Journey</strong></h1>
<h3 local-id=3D"d08808f421e7" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Overview"><st=
rong>Overview</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"d8b3caf64357">This process map represents the complete custo=
mer journey, from initial SMS entry through authentication, case retrieval,=
 decision=E2=80=91making, and final outcomes.</p>
<p local-id=3D"086a67aca56e">The flow is structured into:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"22b30875-421c-455f-958c-760c58a2da3c">
<li local-id=3D"ab27ceb2-00f8-439f-b503-75c276862abc">
<p local-id=3D"48a0d3f1e19d">Linear Entry Flow</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c18f5038-cff8-4b8f-bd28-e3110dd3d62c">
<p local-id=3D"c02bfdc3b6d7">Authentication &amp; Recovery Handling</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"2e8caa86-7cdc-4af1-922c-d1e2819bbe1a">
<p local-id=3D"aeaf577e6cdb">Decision Branching (Core Journey Split)</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"3b42f8f2-7840-41ff-878f-150cc6a7772c">
<p local-id=3D"db86c6681c50">Transactional &amp; Support Paths</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0a50c169-8340-4506-ba37-de3afab1c7c3">
<p local-id=3D"9dee1e0af934">Post=E2=80=91Action Outcomes</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"0c4c1226ab80">This ensures a controlled, secure, and recover=
able journey with no dead ends.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"fcf9cc90ace1" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-1.EntryFlow">=
<strong>1. Entry Flow </strong></h1>
<h3 local-id=3D"47467c4900d8" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-1.1SMSEntry">=
<strong>1.1 SMS Entry</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"6953fc27-c395-4903-b1c9-26885eb6242d">
<li local-id=3D"eda09937-8631-4604-8334-645f31232507">
<p local-id=3D"7ea18e09acba">Customer receives an SMS containing a generic,=
 non=E2=80=91personalised link</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"54ce198d-4ab0-4876-b3ec-a97110be37a4">
<p local-id=3D"e104a3af3d6e">Entry point into the landing page journey</p><=
/li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"180898384a5d"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"35973c03db93" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-1.2Entry/Sign=
=E2=80=91InPage"><strong>1.2 Entry / Sign=E2=80=91In Page</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"9ad4d569-2e1e-44a0-b296-9e4daaa83481">
<li local-id=3D"00eb8270-7eaf-49c3-8cb0-a912f807f64a">
<p local-id=3D"24191abdeb32">Customer enters:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"f4b99f7a-05ec-46fa-a7fa-4cc14f6a0b67">
<li local-id=3D"0d7cb770-42ca-410a-8b38-cea22731a846">
<p local-id=3D"a233063c62e5">Postcode</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"81ffb014-a3de-4162-9b04-65a83b6b5f8e">
<p local-id=3D"37a272ad3b58">Date of Birth</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"9820ffda-d230-48fe-a3d9-b87776507348">
<p local-id=3D"49bba9183c63">System enforces:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"77d928ab-fdee-4696-a050-7164c77169e2">
<li local-id=3D"72656afb-c3b6-4e97-afec-e50686b29dc4">
<p local-id=3D"49c589c1d1a3">Maximum 3 sign=E2=80=91in attempts</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"0ae09c0f-ab27-49d5-b007-1c6e2aa04a3a">
<p local-id=3D"ee40ccbf251c">On success:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"3fc13075-1724-4fc2-ba23-228d96261a2f">
<li local-id=3D"54f3e728-8433-46f4-8dbd-a075a80d232d">
<p local-id=3D"d82ffa540b8d">Secure session is initiated</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"6f0b180a6a0a"></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"f053736a8cf1" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-2.Authenticat=
ion&amp;RecoveryHandling"><strong>2. Authentication &amp; Recovery Handling=
</strong></h1>
<h3 local-id=3D"3a6a5f90bd0e" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-2.1Successful=
Sign=E2=80=91In"><strong>2.1 Successful Sign=E2=80=91In</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"e088ccc1-6917-4e9b-bb53-640a7003b48c">
<li local-id=3D"54c0b8be-587c-4a3f-aacd-c257b5935f29">
<p local-id=3D"9722b707a54d">Customer is authenticated</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6ab368d3-cb02-4f6d-877d-9c53dc40ce9a">
<p local-id=3D"77840cf57de5">Journey continues to: =E2=86=92 Case Retrieval=
</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"3a19cdf27753"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"8c7feda14b81" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-2.2FailedSign=
=E2=80=91InAttempts"><strong>2.2 Failed Sign=E2=80=91In Attempts</strong></=
h3>
<ul local-id=3D"d9081198-ee4e-4b7d-94b8-cea8171a4aa8">
<li local-id=3D"26d20966-6799-4924-8c90-35146bf45d74">
<p local-id=3D"6eddb80050fd">Each failed attempt:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ac3d7dfc-4399-46b4-b3dd-048859bf5115">
<li local-id=3D"912b3dd3-c177-4a8c-bbed-4c26e929c4ac">
<p local-id=3D"4be25d77becf">Reduces remaining attempts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4238d7a3-ee1f-4a93-a737-fa9eb8f34211">
<p local-id=3D"883438beb554">Displays contextual warning to customer</p></l=
i>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"cad2f47cf482"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"9b5162a262bf" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-2.3MaximumAtt=
emptsReached(3Attempts)"><strong>2.3 Maximum Attempts Reached (3 Attempts)<=
/strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"b96cfd5e-1b15-4c91-8e09-a33fdf6d203f">
<li local-id=3D"43de4a58-4af5-4b7d-b6ed-07bd6ce39e4b">
<p local-id=3D"d8f9655fb92b">Customer is moved into <strong>Account Recover=
y Flow</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"69bc2877314d"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"c4d829529042" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-2.4AccountRec=
overy(VerificationMode)"><strong>2.4 Account Recovery (Verification Mode)</=
strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"9e2cc5aeeb80">Customer must complete additional verification=
.</p>
<h4 local-id=3D"bfbbff3f1d8a" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Pass">Pass</h=
4>
<ul local-id=3D"02ecd3d3-e56c-4960-9ff7-0bdbb82492d8">
<li local-id=3D"29cd2e6f-6370-49ac-8e87-b24214082f6a">
<p local-id=3D"b0390ef9f54d">Customer is successfully re=E2=80=91authentica=
ted</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c9fa4685-6828-44a9-8ca2-d5ee1fce3808">
<p local-id=3D"59da25c94117">Redirected back into: =E2=86=92 <strong>Case R=
etrieval</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"7577d3a2c617" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Fail">Fail</h=
4>
<ul local-id=3D"12932879-045c-4c97-94c6-d0a4fb87d0c4">
<li local-id=3D"e856e489-2ae9-409a-b55b-2a85f3cc6403">
<p local-id=3D"9425e7cccba4">Customer account is <strong>locked</strong></p=
></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"def449073eb1"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"e7fe3a9fc25f" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-2.5AccountLoc=
kedState"><strong>2.5 Account Locked State</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"778f6ce1-17bc-4955-b0b2-9de52948b825">
<li local-id=3D"c97c8b6b-0b33-4f4f-a2d0-0ca3d166415b">
<p local-id=3D"d3a7cf443a51">User access is restricted</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b2834ede-fb68-4857-b30b-5e6b1777e3f1">
<p local-id=3D"7298f7d909d7">Customer is presented with escalation options<=
/p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"df413b1050c3"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"a6b6fecf2795" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-2.6Escalation=
/AssistedSupport"><strong>2.6 Escalation / Assisted Support</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"f9a312e3c5f2">Customer is routed to:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"753a1688-75a1-4b89-8d9c-9d171392d208">
<li local-id=3D"e658d596-da2a-4d9e-a40d-76b8ae1506ec">
<p local-id=3D"954790ca8290"><strong>Phone Support</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b5fa27bb-e4c7-4d08-98ab-4946bbbb0ff9">
<p local-id=3D"9eb39729d7b2"><strong>Email Support</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"afb11abbf468">=E2=9E=A1 These channels operate <strong>outsi=
de of the digital journey</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"aea29d2df0dc"></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"9c55196fce91" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-3.CaseRetriev=
al"><strong>3. Case Retrieval</strong></h1>
<ul local-id=3D"3cf881e7-8232-48e5-bb0d-3cbd0e2cf8f2">
<li local-id=3D"c8d870a5-fad3-4d8d-8700-badcb3c13996">
<p local-id=3D"1d96ffeaffbc">System retrieves all active cases from Columbu=
s</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b9991b66-781c-4497-896c-74d07720d72e">
<p local-id=3D"2433d7467c0f">Data includes:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"a3d14971-0769-46a8-88f5-5d703f6f32c3">
<li local-id=3D"f473c03c-40da-42fc-a566-8e75805de560">
<p local-id=3D"9ff6c665d47c">Phase/Stage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1c4766c7-a071-4049-8dc6-5c170a0833bb">
<p local-id=3D"efc7d7320759">Case status</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"31c846a9bb45">This data drives:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"514f1dab-e596-43b8-8b0e-a10a46eb4c1e">
<li local-id=3D"e2446e9c-3265-461c-ae71-bc0589f1e17c">
<p local-id=3D"abe48517816c">Timeline rendering</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"479ed868-b2dd-4c36-855f-7c1b953e0d09">
<p local-id=3D"4f9d5098d79a">Personalisation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9e447cd5-16bd-4bd1-b5e6-816495a86b46">
<p local-id=3D"8ceb568f7972">Decision logic</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d0dff08980e2"></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"c0a9447db83a" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-4.Home/Timeli=
nePage(MainLandingPage)"><strong>4. Home / Timeline Page (Main Landing Page=
)</strong></h1>
<ul local-id=3D"c1a2a402-a729-40c1-b455-b028b8488294">
<li local-id=3D"d5ce24a1-4a31-43e8-a9d3-7558b95cee14">
<p local-id=3D"7c756d6c95fb">Default case is automatically selected</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"240a600a-47eb-4e70-85b7-5bf53210c611">
<p local-id=3D"c8094255e31a">Timeline is rendered based on enforcement stag=
e</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1a802965-ed0a-4d64-8c36-a221eaaaf55c">
<p local-id=3D"518c8876a149">Media panel updates dynamically</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"42541270-4c43-4123-8427-e6bf09f975c6">
<p local-id=3D"dce6c066936b">Primary Call=E2=80=91to=E2=80=91Action (CTA) i=
s presented</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"9ba5a891fee2">This page represents the <strong>central decis=
ion point of the journey</strong>.</p>
<p local-id=3D"27979df59f43"></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"98b96433d460" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-5.DecisionPoi=
nt(CustomerPortalLandingPage)"><strong>5. Decision Point (Customer Portal L=
anding Page)</strong></h1>
<p local-id=3D"d178a5b1a69a">From the Home / Timeline page, the customer se=
lects one of the following paths:</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"2337436734f2" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-5.1PayNow(Pri=
maryPath)">5.1 Pay Now (Primary Path)</h3>
