<h2 local-id=3D"ff7567473a8f" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-1.ProductVisi=
onStatement(Epic).5">1. Product Vision Statement (Epic)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"a45d226b522a">This capability defines a consolidated and sim=
plified model of enforcement phases and stages, translating complex Columbu=
s back=E2=80=91office data into a clear, structured journey that can be acc=
urately represented within the customer landing page experience.</p>
<p local-id=3D"2edc5b540a11"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"52a534a666da" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-2.BusinessObj=
ectives.5">2. Business Objectives</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"37f2ef4f-c508-4bca-8393-ca6dd9e22674">
<li local-id=3D"eee06524-5a88-4f70-bc95-95f138dc9e52">
<p local-id=3D"789e4e04602d">Simplify complex Columbus stage data into a cu=
stomer=E2=80=91friendly model</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ff3d82d2-66f0-4c82-a464-1a26eb7d50ea">
<p local-id=3D"b1d55b11fc3a">Ensure accurate mapping between backend data a=
nd UI journey</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9356f4bd-735c-426b-b8f5-3c5bd08aa836">
<p local-id=3D"76e547cc7e29">Enable consistent rendering of timeline/progre=
ss bar</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"601afe60-1468-4dc6-a94f-62fa87e2ba03">
<p local-id=3D"c6ed32a74529">Support compliance=E2=80=91driven enforcement =
messaging</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"18717314-7612-432c-a08a-6b0fc62a45b7">
<p local-id=3D"cdcf14738ce1">Prevent misinterpretation of enforcement posit=
ion</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d3fa8e8d04d2"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"c4d7cf61e59d" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-3.LandingPage=
Strategy&amp;ContentCustomisation.5">3. Landing Page Strategy &amp; Content=
 Customisation</h2>
<p local-id=3D"a54ef1501535">The customer journey is driven by <strong>phas=
es retrieved from Columbus</strong>, but:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"8de7aa81-6bd3-469f-964a-a68f00f07468">
<li local-id=3D"66633a94-a2ae-437f-8f24-4815fb738062">
<p local-id=3D"3b116abd5df4">Only relevant enforcement phases are used</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"db8c91d8-edf3-4b85-81cf-ba2ed3f3e403">
<p local-id=3D"31d0075df94e">UI displays a simplified 4=E2=80=91stage journ=
ey aligned to enforcement progression</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"7e54d7cf57bc">The mapping ensures:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"eb2b4d84-489d-44d5-80ed-86fae0421b96">
<li local-id=3D"64e91255-e224-4fcd-a595-0c58acb3f4ad">
<p local-id=3D"49c74a859f95">Clarity for customers</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5f34fc2c-caca-4f68-8546-79e1a9565bcf">
<p local-id=3D"1ad71ff4e160">Consistency across all cases</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"14edf066-521b-4bcc-846a-01adec8699b5">
<p local-id=3D"0368efa21675">Accurate positioning on the timeline</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"cef3d2b9f2d8"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"6f663305dce6" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-4.Tracking&am=
p;ReportingEnhancements.5">4. Tracking &amp; Reporting Enhancements</h2>
<p local-id=3D"282763d345ab">The system must track:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"43b133d5-cda6-4ce2-87e7-a96e7e6f77b4">
<li local-id=3D"253294ed-251e-486f-997e-6dae8e4d0d67">
<p local-id=3D"8f569c414905">Phase and stage received from Columbus</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"4f543f60-357f-43e1-9291-6adac497ef71">
<p local-id=3D"129bea91de6b">Mapped journey stage (Stage 1=E2=80=934)</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"5c4830c8-ea27-4850-9c7f-cbdc300fe444">
<p local-id=3D"52df87b3c5e8">Case status and hold conditions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"21ab20ac-2414-4292-9e2d-12b080421bd8">
<p local-id=3D"a2bb06469b6e">Time spent in each stage</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"563cb8bb92ed">This enables:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"e099ab13-4b33-4710-865e-df1248a1cc0f">
<li local-id=3D"f7e021fe-f8f4-455f-978a-f5acdb65778b">
<p local-id=3D"50fd29f55c29">Journey performance tracking</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"250a8da5-6a45-4081-989d-3365f32e9cff">
<p local-id=3D"9a32a47316f8">Drop=E2=80=91off analysis by stage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4c7dbb7c-e175-4242-bc43-8f62827728d4">
<p local-id=3D"4231ab7ec633">Compliance reporting</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"60dcb827098f"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"bff7261fd076" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-5.Scope.5">5.=
 Scope</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"14c7589b7b4a" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-InScope.4">In=
 Scope</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"d11f68f4-3017-452c-9f0c-64cf1174132b">
<li local-id=3D"df66d17d-12d6-4fa9-b158-4a2202e66fc4">
<p local-id=3D"f6afc504f14e">Mapping Columbus <strong>Phase =E2=86=92 UI St=
age (1=E2=80=934)</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"62de389b-1cfa-4e65-9859-25beb1d1f1a2">
<p local-id=3D"3ba0c083243f">Enforcement journey consolidation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6610ab6f-7e18-4567-9a3f-ff0c7667b173">
