<h2 local-id=3D"917a907cad79" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-8.BusinessRul=
es.5">8. Business Rules</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"f66a27ad-d9d0-4b38-9cc5-340f04ad2d45">
<li local-id=3D"cfd21c92-0fbf-4f90-91a0-090d11aa363d">
<p local-id=3D"2a3d7153afe4">The Phase is the primary driver of journey map=
ping</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1e34f845-bb0d-4aee-bd42-078dc5e690df">
<p local-id=3D"4da815437282">Stage interpretation is dependent on Phase</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"ca2cbcc8-3bf3-4cfe-a1b0-749b6262e574">
<p local-id=3D"5c3a1681f72b">Only the following phases are valid for this j=
ourney:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"4ba16d4d-03a2-4065-8757-f5cc50b65394">
<li local-id=3D"614dd7be-76e2-4f4b-80eb-f19bbe6087a3">
<p local-id=3D"9af8c859a4da">Data Cleanse</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1fdb5322-cb60-4ba9-888f-bd7666e69257">
<p local-id=3D"769666696035">Compliance</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a59fa86f-8735-4ea3-9521-a1db0180de3b">
<p local-id=3D"acc17b09e7fa">Enforcement</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2d2a9213-606a-4109-a222-055a04441661">
<p local-id=3D"35cbb6c60bfc">Post=E2=80=91Enforcement</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"175cdc91-3147-4ce6-8813-20e81bd2cf2c">
<p local-id=3D"32768718facc">Case Monitoring</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"f8c1d78c-712c-4eed-8441-fc09fbc38870">
<p local-id=3D"75b7eb422a87">Other Columbus phases must be ignored</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"04ce9a45-bf09-4a11-ba8f-22f8629d8728">
<p local-id=3D"1ab616921434">Hold status does not change stage, only extend=
s time within stage</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"fbb7030c3745"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"e22ffa3ea4ee" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-9.Personalisa=
tionLogic.5">9. Personalisation Logic</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"5b93f69c-43e4-46dd-aba2-5c4f56637207">
<li local-id=3D"eaa2eb01-dc98-4bf7-acbe-a1c82ed5ee23">
<p local-id=3D"6321cd9c1d84">Stage displayed to the user is based on:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"979524d0-1303-445c-8b7c-92865c5531a0">
<li local-id=3D"cc300613-a1e6-47df-8539-3502db3bc138">
<p local-id=3D"a54266d05252">Phase</p></li>
