<p local-id=3D"eb9857863a61">Stage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9960bb4a-8399-46f2-8142-1a3614178ade">
<p local-id=3D"e960fe62079b">Case Status</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"6f27b913-cd44-45e8-8fac-5b04fce36a50">
<p local-id=3D"232f0472d22d">Messaging, urgency, and timeline position adap=
t based on:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"24cbd3ff-f2dc-4dd4-bcce-d6bb6e709c7f">
<li local-id=3D"428efadd-e366-462c-a2e6-642ddd704c9f">
<p local-id=3D"1671dd3475b8">Stage progression</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7ecadbde-8d38-4786-9b36-dd66825be671">
<p local-id=3D"a7163d8e2e4a">Enforcement severity</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"45f710ba-4f32-4167-9952-cb8d96d2cf67">
<p local-id=3D"c37554bb6b78">Hold conditions</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
