<p local-id=3D"766880135c8c">Stage 3 =E2=86=92 Red</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"858e8f14-d09b-4516-b0d4-cf9e21223e02">
<p local-id=3D"1ac1bead275a">Stage 4 =E2=86=92 Dark Red / Critical</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"c7f272b8-90c7-4f5d-ba50-add11247efa4">
<p local-id=3D"e186e3d55be6">Must align with enforcement messaging and urge=
ncy levels</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"62807e65855a"></p>
