<li local-id=3D"6b79f428-a971-4dcc-82fc-2e5a8d2c4042">
<p local-id=3D"8412807e4884"><strong>Meaning:</strong> Enforcement action u=
nderway; fees applied</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b1cfe5e5-fea4-4a74-af18-ae8287f01833">
<p local-id=3D"929107c72807"><strong>Case Status Example:</strong> On Hold<=
/p></li>
