<h2 local-id=3D"07b7337a8a69" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-18.Component=
=E2=80=91SpecificBehaviour.5">18. Component=E2=80=91Specific Behaviour</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"0f70b79b1c1c" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Phase=E2=86=
=92StageMapping">Phase =E2=86=92 Stage Mapping</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"158bd4e5-a924-48d0-8665-85708ac4f4ee">
<li local-id=3D"ef2c1c89-bdba-487e-a079-3ac13dbe0613">
<p local-id=3D"fe69471f1d2d">Mapping driven first by Phase</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"08d7b37b-64de-45a2-82fe-e13ec7261b4a">
<p local-id=3D"62a861bf1a51">Then refined by Stage</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"9b96310108b1" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Multi=E2=80=
=91PhaseHandling">Multi=E2=80=91Phase Handling</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"61778ebd-5cf4-43e4-acda-dc2c8a630631">
<li local-id=3D"aabff04a-c29d-4277-86e2-13a9b944871f">
<p local-id=3D"7d955e48057e">Multiple Columbus phases (Enforcement, Post=E2=
=80=91Enforcement, Case Monitoring) map to same UI stage</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"18169ba49386" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-CaseStatusInf=
luence">Case Status Influence</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"40a6b4f0-f2ed-4436-a40d-abdf5d9b0814">
<li local-id=3D"7dd4346f-4b20-47f7-b777-701c2e31aa91">
<p local-id=3D"0282b96e3a71">Case status does not alter stage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7d066435-53e4-4b71-9ed6-0887efdfe43c">
<p local-id=3D"732f8e98590d">It provides contextual messaging</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"ac3940d72785"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"1bcf27ff3fdf" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-19.HoldType/T=
imeLogic(Critical)">19. Hold Type / Time Logic (Critical)</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"110eb7e1-25e6-4a2f-b1ce-e81448c9fab2">
<li local-id=3D"aa30d2d1-0aa8-4aed-b3f7-e777ef0f9117">
<p local-id=3D"e7ed482d71c9">If <strong>Case Status =3D On Hold</strong>:</=
p>
<ul local-id=3D"be09ab36-7d06-4d95-bb2f-ece7b7f719c9">
<li local-id=3D"3d43b520-fa39-4910-92c5-1bf53c6a8735">
<p local-id=3D"03ffd9062b51">The customer remains in the same stage</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"6dde7283-efa8-4035-af47-6b11033adf0b">
<p local-id=3D"88af45181ae3">The duration of that stage is extended</p></li=
>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"2d88cfc24a5a">Example:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ff582f48-b2eb-43a1-aec1-da1b2c0605f5">
<li local-id=3D"f33ba540-0e48-464a-9131-b81db2df2440">
<p local-id=3D"da154921315b">Stage 1 =3D 14 days</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1370433f-dc8d-48a6-884b-f4c1fcb0a43f">
<p local-id=3D"d340ac986cd5">If hold applied (e.g. Vulnerability):</p>
<ul local-id=3D"e4d0d6e3-02e1-41fd-b0e4-0ffff6b3d323">
<li local-id=3D"985cee10-88b3-48c7-bc42-10649415b00e">
<p local-id=3D"88cb3e8133d8">Stage =3D remains Stage 1</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"010dde04-75f2-44f6-8a36-371300eb09d5">
<p local-id=3D"c72f91f53b73">Duration =3D 14 days + hold duration</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"6335f9712721"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"f88254a15e96" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-20.Risks&amp;=
Dependencies">20. Risks &amp; Dependencies</h2>
<p local-id=3D"9a6d6efbc26a"><strong>Risks</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"fd93ec84-6e71-49fe-82d9-011896c73785">
<li local-id=3D"7e86075c-ab8e-4f69-8aff-fbbb3dfc7f83">
<p local-id=3D"712e7fb7bff6">Incorrect mapping could misrepresent enforceme=
nt stage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b23d89b1-0c2b-4ca2-bf85-b82f6d2cea2c">
<p local-id=3D"5fce5149438b">Over=E2=80=91simplification could lose nuance<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"60c1b631-6f69-4fda-a0a7-38824a8455d2">
<p local-id=3D"ccf6c66b9e4e">Dependency on Columbus data accuracy</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"8ff9473db92e"><strong>Dependencies</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"15b7b1f1-03bc-4ced-8cb9-8f3d7987a1a0">
<li local-id=3D"e3a2ba12-3261-4996-8554-dbc1be96c7b5">
<p local-id=3D"4b5b02ddd6fa">Columbus phase &amp; stage structure</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a68d458c-ce18-47f6-9a45-9e622536f312">
<p local-id=3D"87c02da7feaa">Case status reliability</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f12dc5ef-f65f-4103-a960-4149924c7025">
<p local-id=3D"029c5db7bd05">Agreement on mapping logic</p></li>
</ul>
