<p local-id=3D"4e2df78121ae"></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"8b40147cced3" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-PERMISSIONS&a=
mp;APPROVALMODEL-BUSINESS=E2=80=91LEDGOVERNANCE"><strong>PERMISSIONS &amp; =
APPROVAL MODEL - BUSINESS=E2=80=91LED GOVERNANCE</strong></h1>
<p local-id=3D"c3c70f418c4c">Capability Type: Governance / Operational Cont=
rol<br>
Scope: Cross=E2=80=91cutting (applies to all landing pages, content, and jo=
urney updates)<br>
Purpose: Ensure controlled, auditable, and compliant management of changes =
without requiring additional technical build.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"00dc845d5e6d" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-1.ProductVisi=
onStatement(Epic).6">1. Product Vision Statement (Epic)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"c80c19c6f781">This capability introduces a structured, busin=
ess=E2=80=91led approval and governance model to manage changes across land=
ing pages, content, and journey logic, ensuring compliance, accountability,=
 and auditability without the need for additional system functionality.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"1357f0450b5d" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-2.BusinessObj=
ectives.6">2. Business Objectives</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"576c93ea-2856-43c3-83c6-86d961cbde83">
<li local-id=3D"6e4314e8-e8ce-40a8-9553-588958de5554">
<p local-id=3D"658333568fac">Ensure all changes undergo appropriate review =
and approval</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9859ecdd-303f-48b3-a62f-3321ba7f67bf">
<p local-id=3D"fd4a92a5ba0d">Maintain segregation of duties across change l=
ifecycle</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"06dcd5c0-e00a-421c-b9c0-fa4dab932b47">
<p local-id=3D"f5c73afb5d66">Provide a clear audit trail for all updates</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"0e161dd6-aa41-46a5-9c8e-0ddc4939bd23">
<p local-id=3D"7ba5ab00022c">Reduce reliance on technical development for g=
overnance</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5a6a4695-45d6-4ef2-8f80-1c02ddda6717">
<p local-id=3D"b39bcd00cbdb">Enable efficient, scalable business=E2=80=91si=
de change management</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"8db161062e33" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-3.LandingPage=
Strategy&amp;ContentCustomisation.6">3. Landing Page Strategy &amp; Content=
 Customisation</h2>
<p local-id=3D"d3dd2716ec54">All updates to:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7dcc7270-6bce-410f-9b1a-a4af54dad1c8">
<li local-id=3D"4f68d80d-828f-4583-acf7-eb0adad8308f">
<p local-id=3D"6ea749cd5120">Landing page content</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"162e860f-c6e4-4626-9566-bf683c178694">
<p local-id=3D"6c98fee5defd">Journey flows</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"914e0a6a-e163-4fa3-b1fa-465cd8625355">
<p local-id=3D"03b3856161ff">Messaging</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e397e275-d944-4bce-808a-c64340750a9d">
<p local-id=3D"5ce5ba8e0f75">Commission logic (where applicable)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"a8d8b43dc778">must pass through the defined approval model b=
efore being published.</p>
<p local-id=3D"e25765658591">This ensures:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"b1b571f1-b60a-4cd8-9201-379b158382dd">
<li local-id=3D"48e39a20-fc0a-496d-8b58-3cbf7b262dc7">
<p local-id=3D"edd045a1cf5f">Consistency across all customer=E2=80=91facing=
 touchpoints</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1354e6dc-42fc-46e9-9a61-9e375f7d0599">
<p local-id=3D"b36f96493ccf">Alignment with enforcement and compliance mess=
aging</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bf8d931d-549f-4110-8d05-08fafe02c7dd">
<p local-id=3D"b1cee3b56097">Controlled evolution of the customer journey</=
p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"53390321addb" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-4.Tracking&am=
p;ReportingEnhancements.6">4. Tracking &amp; Reporting Enhancements</h2>
<p local-id=3D"c2b40984a3a8">The approval process must support audit and tr=
aceability through:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"a3287cb8-da5e-4360-aa6f-5c04b2a3ba14">
<li local-id=3D"c1fd57c1-f258-4864-92d7-01a3013c1d8e">
<p local-id=3D"0127ce67ed18">Ticket creation logs</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ac50c191-2082-471f-b0ab-d444b47fd0cb">
<p local-id=3D"5e208e788e6a">Approval / rejection records</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"243e36d6-5bea-415c-a795-240df674d24c">
<p local-id=3D"3390cc78cfcb">Publisher confirmation logs</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9e3bb92f-99b4-4859-b1e9-70bac97adf4b">
<p local-id=3D"f612ddacf518">Time and user stamps for each stage</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"e231bbb23f93">These records will support:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d5ae8075-123c-48bd-ad53-60e0a6eaa98a">
<li local-id=3D"fe143cf9-3111-411f-8d29-585b9a3106b3">
<p local-id=3D"ba64a0022e08">Internal audits</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4152b950-85da-415b-9f95-e2a7b2ff7c19">
<p local-id=3D"1bb658f7c0b9">Compliance reviews</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"887ba368-22c5-4105-b84d-c6c569da3847">
<p local-id=3D"77d372e1262c">Change traceability</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"3da175ff964f" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-5.Scope.6">5.=
 Scope</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"89d774dad5fc" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-InScope.5">In=
 Scope</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"f5fff78e-f606-41ef-a545-43e09ee96fc9">
<li local-id=3D"d2ba94a7-4c77-4e9a-904b-07def36b47a4">
<p local-id=3D"c0098342091e">Content updates</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"54cffebe-67fb-450a-8eef-3e87c16cf9f7">
<p local-id=3D"58bffbe16fe5">Landing page changes</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2ff0d02d-fb6d-4ea9-a01f-63c5db7d62d8">
<p local-id=3D"20b3e4e5e1f1">Journey adjustments</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9a48f987-b666-4811-ad6a-9b359aed66a2">
<p local-id=3D"13f7c1ef6cdc">Commission/content rule updates</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"b099493191be" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-OutofScope.5"=
>Out of Scope</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"2f54527d-e7c8-4d29-9ae2-04465d9709dd">
<li local-id=3D"d09aca26-1a4d-48a7-bbf9-35ce97a15923">
<p local-id=3D"6b1ce1c87755">System=E2=80=91level permissions framework dev=
elopment</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ae790612-bec3-46cb-869f-1db799e10745">
<p local-id=3D"2f73f572ff23">Role=E2=80=91based access control (RBAC) syste=
ms</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fe6f1442-837c-4193-8fe0-a73b499032e7">
<p local-id=3D"27d47bfe40be">Automated approval engines</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"3c503133f8ec" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-6.Users.6">6.=
 Users</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"0b1a9508-a250-4c49-a4d8-066ca983f669">
<li local-id=3D"525d3bee-7bf3-432d-8427-4236af75c2cb">
<p local-id=3D"b9b6a7a76a2a"><strong>Author:</strong> Business user creatin=
g or proposing change</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"adf7a9da-0fec-4ea3-968e-4e79e29323c0">
<p local-id=3D"d433c72901d6"><strong>Reviewer:</strong> Business/compliance=
 validator</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f59b85f0-3309-4ff1-a7cc-440b3d4f6da6">
<p local-id=3D"71575b9d4d05"><strong>Publisher:</strong> Final approver res=
ponsible for release</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9c6635e6-315c-4fd5-8f15-bd5dbe00a635">
<p local-id=3D"815b4fadac02"><strong>Compliance Leads:</strong> Oversight/a=
udit</p></li>
</ul>
