<h2 local-id=3D"9b666490335b" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-8.BusinessRul=
es.6">8. Business Rules</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"94716ca7-9f4a-49de-b350-f015d0b859be">
<li local-id=3D"d4227d73-9e14-4dd5-8882-9b342a1dd3d6">
<p local-id=3D"bb7c0b9a63bf">A single individual <strong>must not</strong> =
act as:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"605abc23-23fb-4ed4-a0c1-d43749fd4d2b">
<li local-id=3D"80e73ea0-23e2-4f17-a3fc-3ea31b7db712">
<p local-id=3D"890db9373f86">Author AND Reviewer</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eea87983-2b86-4636-b233-19588b90891e">
<p local-id=3D"b95e076502d0">Reviewer AND Publisher</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3a826695-3e7e-43c2-a784-e244871b29e7">
<p local-id=3D"7de70209a717">Author AND Publisher</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"6c67880c-1f80-43da-93e1-7762fb2e6e63">
<p local-id=3D"b30827f18dc6">Every change must pass through all three stage=
s:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"8e341d8e-924e-465c-b3fc-15d0e5aa1923">
<li local-id=3D"23c616cb-9ca4-4d57-b804-972b50542a61">
<p local-id=3D"aa4c724e025b">Author</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ab557529-3cca-491b-aa84-4031d3b1c201">
<p local-id=3D"d76c29413e08">Reviewer</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"adbf4846-8918-42c8-baf9-b8f23a1d7348">
<p local-id=3D"f0964fa7dbd3">Publisher</p></li>
</ol></li>
<li local-id=3D"800450c3-79e6-4be6-b53d-e36174695eac">
<p local-id=3D"7bc9f119a84b">No changes may be published without:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"1a3aa497-087f-4285-8a3c-881b1142e057">
<li local-id=3D"eeabc6a1-45cf-45a2-9c00-ae3bd122e00e">
<p local-id=3D"4a9adce270c6">Explicit reviewer approval</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c9782597-aa75-42af-b838-f70ba54a09d7">
<p local-id=3D"57f95925aace">Final publisher sign=E2=80=91off</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"2eaf2c88-0883-4210-baab-4f8784fdc816">
<p local-id=3D"feb652f3fac2">Rejected changes must be:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"f41a5740-1678-4b27-b97a-fc6f111995ef">
<li local-id=3D"0be79f31-fa5f-4f6c-80a1-cc05bd37d9eb">
<p local-id=3D"80e4d26c92e8">Returned to Author with feedback</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3c088a9e-67e9-40a1-adbe-58189b057e49">
<p local-id=3D"2586d3cc5c90">Not progressed further</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"4b22c4065912" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-9.Personalisa=
tionLogic.6">9. Personalisation Logic</h2>
<p local-id=3D"55086183b7aa">This capability does not directly control pers=
onalisation, however:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"e6e0d5b9-c364-4640-9af7-28db12e626c9">
<li local-id=3D"33988432-c598-4151-802d-044bf24f41ca">
<p local-id=3D"d8affe31adb3">Approved changes may include updates to:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"a29c1734-6760-4c75-a4cb-0345cfca0958">
<li local-id=3D"a29e7594-25db-42c6-b5d7-2b05f9624929">
<p local-id=3D"cc1252eaa89f">Personalisation messaging</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8b2b29f6-cdbc-459b-9062-02e6e0f725ff">
<p local-id=3D"1efc57a478e6">Case=E2=80=91based content logic</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"3db6e215-97cb-4b9f-b80d-9cb2f2d5249c">
<p local-id=3D"6c55a4cac1b1">All personalisation changes must follow this a=
pproval model</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"cca3c3303325" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-10.BusinessPr=
ocess/Illustration.6">10. Business Process / Illustration</h2>
<p local-id=3D"be5b10a9a418"><strong>Step=E2=80=91by=E2=80=91Step Flow:</st=
rong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"549be03b-1b28-4401-82a7-25bf4512a5af">
<li local-id=3D"d6913d6c-0da1-4a23-905c-2e7ef4277587">
<p local-id=3D"6766b0c09da3"><strong>Author</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"3502f934-7565-4303-9f59-0cac376eabcb">
<li local-id=3D"c32e857a-a710-4830-901f-7c2b03decaa5">
<p local-id=3D"92f297340171">Creates or edits content/journey element</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"848e18d3-5fa7-4f67-9a44-1e156ae4bf74">
<p local-id=3D"49e3453563a2">Raises a ticket in the ticketing system</p></l=
i>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"26cb5e76-de6f-46fd-9852-e029e7107ad1">
<p local-id=3D"7a549b042aba"><strong>Reviewer</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"6e5e4e77-7cbd-4e65-b06f-740bae0c24a8">
<li local-id=3D"87b2846e-57db-412e-a414-7cfa13cbc1af">
<p local-id=3D"cb25980fd333">Validates:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7b84ccca-80ea-49c2-b7e3-2adb852f6178">
<li local-id=3D"df805bdc-6916-466f-a72e-fd95ea67c490">
<p local-id=3D"fbe8e816dd54">Accuracy</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bfe6f9eb-48d5-4d65-9743-a77bb2b8c408">
<p local-id=3D"7c2d905ac847">Compliance</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"37f25c93-4ba1-43f5-af60-384ffd1ecf84">
<p local-id=3D"b8ac40035eca">Policy alignment</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"c96f6d56-56d2-4d83-83ab-d9bfd871bfe1">
<p local-id=3D"e6821138cb32">Approves or rejects</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"2e50a1ac-09e4-4752-b074-50edb60ee2fd">
<p local-id=3D"7a768e600bbc"><strong>Publisher</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"dc86175e-cc80-40eb-a488-a0dcb540a15c">
<li local-id=3D"9e3a0a9b-8a36-4c12-8fa5-d92c4882bdd6">
<p local-id=3D"148eaa4b6d06">Reviews approved change</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5ea90f27-d350-4845-a739-9e7fbd0a0e71">
<p local-id=3D"192da0caa212">Publishes to live environment</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"414dcfa4-0d47-4243-a0bb-c5cb06fed593">
<p local-id=3D"f9f8a155bce8">Accountable for final sign=E2=80=91off</p></li=
>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"6f8e7a9027f8" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-11.Enhancemen=
tsIncorporated.6">11. Enhancements Incorporated</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"b4270a75-6615-4d8d-a748-30631863035b">
<li local-id=3D"85386f3b-94a4-4e34-b1fd-2194e99ba075">
<p local-id=3D"d4fc7f860f31">Removal of reliance on technical deployments f=
or minor updates</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3e1c61ed-6737-4f24-8d64-cee580d4605b">
<p local-id=3D"5fed35727cb9">Stronger governance with defined accountabilit=
y layers</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"624f8271-d627-4be5-8ac2-7040f65a9106">
<p local-id=3D"4aab99f1c4d8">Improved auditability for regulatory and compl=
iance purposes</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"213e7751-9766-46fa-a444-39f0db9e09bc">
<p local-id=3D"7ad87e4ca636">Clear separation of responsibilities</p></li>
</ul>
