<h2 local-id=3D"537156f10caa" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-15.Non=E2=80=
=91FunctionalRequirements.6">15. Non=E2=80=91Functional Requirements</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"77fe9a87-d778-4826-b4f7-9a4bb072fb82">
<li local-id=3D"ba7cc038-12a6-4f18-986c-696326238dab">
<p local-id=3D"fdec511b3fed">Full audit traceability</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"85292347-4abe-40ab-adfa-ccfd84e2a9e1">
<p local-id=3D"9162a8094ac5">High reliability of ticketing system</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"85b34239-81d0-47c6-9d50-8fa729f56ba3">
<p local-id=3D"2ce0e5ffda91">No impact on live customer performance</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"7c091969-bc24-49b0-a7bd-94094903d424">
<p local-id=3D"af4db267bdd7">Secure access aligned with internal governance=
</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"30c26ca3b78b" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-16.NewUp=E2=
=80=91To=E2=80=91DateVisualRepresentationRequirement.6">16. New Up=E2=80=91=
To=E2=80=91Date Visual Representation Requirement</h2>
<p local-id=3D"d56f9b85a648">Not applicable to customer UI.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b8c02d47756a">For internal use:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"fc5cdd67-841c-4154-8b1f-c19f277dec55">
<li local-id=3D"f0fe5a19-4b67-4437-85e2-56b21499372e">
<p local-id=3D"eb218a8e7dbf">Clear separation of workflow stages</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"60fe5fdc-248b-430d-8591-1d534ad47100">
<p local-id=3D"72133107e7dc">Visual indication of status:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"fd3ca8a5-3c21-4331-841e-bf8e498dff5a">
<li local-id=3D"ab56ef60-87a0-46fe-9558-b4b73b3996e3">
<p local-id=3D"4065e265a93d">Pending</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8144c61e-836c-4324-807b-3d076df41a22">
<p local-id=3D"fab03df782d2">Approved</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"369c3b03-5f8b-4d9d-a735-ff32459f8442">
<p local-id=3D"7aaad7b3cfd8">Rejected</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c0960f9c-72b7-4c6b-b517-9c8e1336e5d0">
<p local-id=3D"292dcdae78b5">Published</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"9031af72fc30" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-17.Top=E2=80=
=91LevelProcessStructure">17. Top=E2=80=91Level Process Structure</h2>
<p local-id=3D"5f93b2b2f750"><strong>Three=E2=80=91Step Controlled Flow:</s=
trong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"4c228c37-ab57-40cd-ab0e-94437c2e8e3c">
<li local-id=3D"683ffa57-7c41-4ba2-8435-788aa09ff1aa">
<p local-id=3D"9822bcaf542d">Author =E2=86=92 Creates &amp; submits</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"f74af876-9d54-4a91-b66c-cc73615d4e26">
<p local-id=3D"c9d69079a503">Reviewer =E2=86=92 Validates &amp; approves/re=
jects</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dad5f0c7-5024-492e-b1c9-277bb84b0d9a">
<p local-id=3D"54711837523e">Publisher =E2=86=92 Final sign=E2=80=91off &am=
p; publish</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"3407dee3583c" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-18.Component=
=E2=80=91SpecificBehaviour.6">18. Component=E2=80=91Specific Behaviour</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"c63a37fe477e" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Author">Autho=
r</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"233022a9-20a0-410e-ac6d-3435f17f86d4">
<li local-id=3D"d6919b64-473c-4852-9a70-2b728db8ea05">
<p local-id=3D"a42c5ab34b18">Cannot self=E2=80=91approve</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c2b40dab-3490-459e-bcd8-f8f26afb8f92">
<p local-id=3D"19724460d41c">Responsible for initial change accuracy</p></l=
i>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"0656361b3f1f" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Reviewer">Rev=
iewer</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"e3e93159-e152-43c3-9010-7541ecb4c8d6">
<li local-id=3D"a48deafd-40ab-4d2b-9776-845c7ed66d30">
<p local-id=3D"57e9fcac3c18">Must validate against compliance and policy</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"9cfd269f-0d73-45e1-87fb-0704c316158c">
<p local-id=3D"d5362b68facd">Must provide rejection feedback where applicab=
le</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"5020b841292a" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-Publisher"><s=
pan class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"f9fd62d6-c97e-4ab1-95e4-59e=
d44c63c5f">Publisher</span></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"dc7d02e7-fb54-4d0a-a9c3-5f13165ced89">
<li local-id=3D"f4eb84d4-6984-44f8-a74e-cfcb94cae6e5">
<p local-id=3D"e40fd9bd9a68">Final gatekeeper</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"04e6571e-0252-44a0-881e-223d310701d7">
<p local-id=3D"fd84e8dc9565">Responsible for production release</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"70fcd6710ef0" id=3D"NewSuperSlickLandingPages-19.Risks&amp;=
Dependencies.5">19. Risks &amp; Dependencies</h2>
<p local-id=3D"fdf3a1f0c232"><strong>Risks</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"1c554617-324f-4915-82e2-eb4f64684479">
<li local-id=3D"115612cf-d0ed-406c-9672-faa3108088a7">
<p local-id=3D"34981e6a6a0e">Delays if approval stages are not resourced</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"fef42525-3a0d-4aae-83e5-2b7d21378d22">
<p local-id=3D"d70fe51122a6">Risk of bypass if process not enforced</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"bc262b7d-c8f3-42b5-af22-b978324fd532">
<p local-id=3D"d0dcd9fb1b41">Dependency on manual discipline</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d2c62473265d"><strong>Dependencies</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"8a933ea5-2d23-4fbe-9963-51dd4f6f3405">
<li local-id=3D"df8ee478-e3fb-4f6b-8c54-8b42bfcaf0ee">
<p local-id=3D"b130bbee9d90">Ticketing system availability (e.g. Jira)</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"54f1c40e-f65c-4398-a1cc-53c6000bbb65">
<p local-id=3D"bfb181c08ca4">Defined business roles</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"01979311-7439-48ce-9a50-d967607decf6">
<p local-id=3D"e29ff684c841">Compliance oversight</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"22da9ddb30fd"></p>
    </div>
</body>
